	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n4IBLNGPkn_khpjEr",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 13, DX 10, IQ 9, HT 11, HP 13, WILL 9, PER 9, FP 11, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n909s6S6dAXaMprSN",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 17 (offense 14, protection 3), threat tier minor, appearing 8."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkTmNGhupjzGTPsGF",
			"text": "Javelin: Javelin (11): 1d+1 impaling, Reach Ranged, 20. Thrown once at the charge, then forgotten about."
		},
		{
			"id": "n7_-ZKQb_oioPlUAH",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/orc.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nlnxqXWlcUkTVmJ2G",
			"text": "Independent build total: 7 points of racial traits plus 18 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6OgT9eAkIaVfemis",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Orc (SRD 5.1); Orc (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPwwA6s_6mWfxKR_Q",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "naIh2CCUTvySFKc00",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 95 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nP0q7-JocBzvJwBo_",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "ny35-S_NgEIdUG7UT",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n2BGFhvUkptkOnnDc",
			"text": "About 1.85 m standing, which is the SM 0 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "ntVILnf0RjxSSLD62",
			"text": "ST 13 from Basic Lift: heavier and broader than a man of the same height, carrying loot out at a jog."
		},
		{
			"id": "nhPy353jJOlEefFkB",
			"text": "Bloodlust and Bad Temper together are why the fight does not end when it should, and both are published disadvantages rather than prose."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuKiGEqpwhoo8Nq88",
			"text": "Light sensitivity is on the encounter block. See the deep dwarf's note for why it is not a trait."
		},
		{
			"id": "n-4aFglq5nblcjirz",
			"text": "Mail scraps and a shield are common and are not in this record's DR. See decision 11 in the build policy."
		},
		{
			"id": "nJ-QyHH5K0pS7hEn4",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
